        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981010/extras/2b6a65d6c4e54157def54bb0e965dab4.avif?t=1765558977\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981010/extras_big/2b6a65d6c4e54157def54bb0e965dab4.avif?t=1765558977 width=1560 height=388 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In Silent Walls: Subject 13</strong> is a first-person psychological horror narrative game.<br>Twenty years after the disappearance of your sister Elina, you return to the abandoned Red Hollow Sanatorium to face the past and uncover the truth hidden within its silent walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981010/extras/6e2049b06129114df879213ac0f5bc84.poster.avif?t=1765558977\" width=780 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981010/extras/6e2049b06129114df879213ac0f5bc84.webm?t=1765558977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981010/extras/6e2049b06129114df879213ac0f5bc84.mp4?t=1765558977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore decayed corridors, discover disturbing documents and drawings, and slowly piece together the story . Every step brings you closer to the truth… and to madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because within these walls, the past is not just a memory… it is waiting for you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981010/extras/8ad6ebee1bf24d5066d1b242fbb7dc45.webp?t=1765558977\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981010/extras_big/8ad6ebee1bf24d5066d1b242fbb7dc45.avif?t=1765558977 width=1560 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An <strong>immersive and realistic atmosphere</strong> powered by Unreal Engine 5.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>dark, story-rich narrative</strong>, revealed through letters, documents, and the environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration and light puzzles</strong> to progress through the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Terrifying and unsettling scenes</strong>, focused on psychological horror rather than gore.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981010/extras/8b4f714a7b2dd39d53cee12d41c12c59.poster.avif?t=1765558977\" width=780 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981010/extras/8b4f714a7b2dd39d53cee12d41c12c59.webm?t=1765558977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981010/extras/8b4f714a7b2dd39d53cee12d41c12c59.mp4?t=1765558977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Silent Walls: Subject 13</strong> is an independent, family-driven project developed in <strong>France</strong>. More than just a game, it’s the realization of a childhood dream. Thank you to everyone supporting <strong>indie horror</strong>.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981010/extras/2b6a65d6c4e54157def54bb0e965dab4.avif?t=1765558977\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981010/extras_big/2b6a65d6c4e54157def54bb0e965dab4.avif?t=1765558977 width=1560 height=388 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In Silent Walls: Subject 13</strong> is a first-person psychological horror narrative game.<br>Twenty years after the disappearance of your sister Elina, you return to the abandoned Red Hollow Sanatorium to face the past and uncover the truth hidden within its silent walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981010/extras/6e2049b06129114df879213ac0f5bc84.poster.avif?t=1765558977\" width=780 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981010/extras/6e2049b06129114df879213ac0f5bc84.webm?t=1765558977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981010/extras/6e2049b06129114df879213ac0f5bc84.mp4?t=1765558977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore decayed corridors, discover disturbing documents and drawings, and slowly piece together the story . Every step brings you closer to the truth… and to madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because within these walls, the past is not just a memory… it is waiting for you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981010/extras/8ad6ebee1bf24d5066d1b242fbb7dc45.webp?t=1765558977\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981010/extras_big/8ad6ebee1bf24d5066d1b242fbb7dc45.avif?t=1765558977 width=1560 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An <strong>immersive and realistic atmosphere</strong> powered by Unreal Engine 5.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>dark, story-rich narrative</strong>, revealed through letters, documents, and the environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration and light puzzles</strong> to progress through the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Terrifying and unsettling scenes</strong>, focused on psychological horror rather than gore.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981010/extras/8b4f714a7b2dd39d53cee12d41c12c59.poster.avif?t=1765558977\" width=780 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981010/extras/8b4f714a7b2dd39d53cee12d41c12c59.webm?t=1765558977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981010/extras/8b4f714a7b2dd39d53cee12d41c12c59.mp4?t=1765558977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Silent Walls: Subject 13</strong> is an independent, family-driven project developed in <strong>France</strong>. More than just a game, it’s the realization of a childhood dream. Thank you to everyone supporting <strong>indie horror</strong>.</p>",
